[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4740.91, "timestamp": "01:19:00", "text": "比如，呃，比如说，你的父母给你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4744.07, "timestamp": "01:19:04", "text": "金钱和你，而不是说谢谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4746.149, "timestamp": "01:19:06", "text": "你或者任何东西，你只要把它抢走就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4747.91, "timestamp": "01:19:07", "text": "然后就按你自己的方式去做吧"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4749.306, "timestamp": "01:19:09", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "love you too brother pravin"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4749.75, "timestamp": "01:19:09", "text": "表示感谢或表达感激之情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4752.709, "timestamp": "01:19:12", "text": "谢谢你这么努力工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4755.43, "timestamp": "01:19:15", "text": "就像给我钱一样，即使"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4758.149, "timestamp": "01:19:18", "text": "问你这些问题确实很难开口。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4760.229, "timestamp": "01:19:20", "text": "出于好心送给我的，诸如此类"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4762.55, "timestamp": "01:19:22", "text": "就是这样。你不会把所有的话都说出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4764.63, "timestamp": "01:19:24", "text": "你拿去自己做就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4768.31, "timestamp": "01:19:28", "text": "重视这件事，不要忽视它。是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4770.55, "timestamp": "01:19:30", "text": "被预定了吗？呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4772.63, "timestamp": "01:19:32", "text": "因为就像我知道，就像你知道的一样，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4774.47, "timestamp": "01:19:34", "text": "你去的是类似西方学校的学校"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4776.229, "timestamp": "01:19:36", "text": "我猜对了，他们会说“好吧”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4778.55, "timestamp": "01:19:38", "text": "孩子们应该像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4780.55, "timestamp": "01:19:40", "text": "有权继承父母的一切财产"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4782.709, "timestamp": "01:19:42", "text": "对，但我觉得因为我们更像是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4784.87, "timestamp": "01:19:44", "text": "你知道，有点像亚洲学校那种风格。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4786.87, "timestamp": "01:19:46", "text": "在思考中，我们确实会心存感激"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4789.75, "timestamp": "01:19:49", "text": "我们的父母不喜欢他们，因为他们确实"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4791.669, "timestamp": "01:19:51", "text": "对我们来说，这就足够了，而且没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4794.39, "timestamp": "01:19:54", "text": "无论对错，我们认为孩子是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4797.35, "timestamp": "01:19:57", "text": "某种程度上，你有权知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4799.11, "timestamp": "01:19:59", "text": "父母给你的任何东西，因为你"}]